  "details": "Description\n\nI used the beta version a week ago and my game got laggy, so I changed the client to public version and it got fixed. Now I get the same laggy experience after the game update. I hope this can be fixed soon. Thank you.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI tried to change back to the public version a week ago and that fixed the problem. Now occurs because of the update.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1953-d52354d5be-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-28_21-10-10.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_4ef969e9-4e8b-4e8f-a429-a66205e28337/1/file)",
